# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kotoku Mobile — Environment Config
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# PRODUCTION
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.kotoku-app.com
#
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT
#   DO NOT set EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL when using emulators/simulators.
#   The app auto-detects the correct URL:
#     Android emulator → http://10.0.2.2:8000
#     iOS simulator    → http://localhost:8000
#
#   FOR PHYSICAL PHONE TESTING:
#     1. Find your LAN IP:
#          macOS:   ipconfig getifaddr en0
#          Windows: ipconfig | findstr /i "IPv4"
#     2. Uncomment the line below and replace with your IP:
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.x.x:8000
#
#     3. Restart Expo: npx expo start
#
# To switch back to emulator, comment out the line again.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
